Package: libqe
Title: Shared C++ Core for Quantitative Ethnography Packages
Type: Package
Authors@R: c(person("Cody L", "Marquart", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "cody.marquart@wisc.edu", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3387-6792")))
Version: 0.2.5
Description: Shared C++ header library for quantitative ethnography
    packages such as 'rENA' and 'tma', which use it through 'LinkingTo'. It
    provides adjacency-vector utilities, network normalization, group
    statistics (confidence intervals and two-group tests), temporal pooling
    and smoothing of event streams, polynomial trajectory fitting with
    derivative and distance measures, and a stability metric for comparing
    point configurations. Every function is also available from R through
    'Rcpp' wrappers.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/epistemic-analytics/libqe
BugReports: https://github.com/epistemic-analytics/libqe/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Imports:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 2.1.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
NeedsCompilation: yes
